###############################################################################
# SERVICES / DAEMONS (30)
#
# Purpose:
#   Background services and daemons that are enabled via systemd
#   (system-wide or user-level).
#
# What belongs here:
#   - Notification daemons (swaync)
#   - Wallpaper daemons (swww)
#   - Audio services (pipewire, wireplumber)
#   - Bluetooth, printing, power management services
#
# What does NOT belong here:
#   - Applications you manually launch
#   - Fonts, themes, icons
#
###############################################################################


# Audio Stack
pipewire
pipewire-alsa
pipewire-jack
pipewire-pulse

# Networking / Discovery
nss-mdns

# Power / Time
power-profiles-daemon

# Printing / FirewaLL
cups
cups-filters
cups-browsed
cups-pdf
ufw
